    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everyone says that but it doesn't change the reality of it. like talking to a therapist won't change the fact that we're just tiny specks in a dead universe. it's just so exhausting pretending that there's a point to any of this when i know there isn't. it's just a loop of nothingness until we stop. does it even make sense to keep trying to find meaning when there's just nothing there?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
